  FormBox[
   SubsuperscriptBox["V", "rrr", "s"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "f1635bc1-ad06-453d-9928-ef37e873da5c"],
 " in Table 2  are represented by SphericalV\[Lambda]\[Lambda]\[Lambda], \
SphericalV\[Lambda]\[Lambda]\[Phi], SphericalV\[Lambda]\[Lambda]r, SphericalV\
\[Lambda]\[Phi]r, SphericalV\[Phi]\[Phi]\[Lambda], SphericalV\[Phi]\[Phi]\
\[Phi], SphericalV\[Phi]\[Phi]r, SphericalVrr\[Lambda], SphericalVrr\[Phi], \
and SphericalVrrr. \n3. ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubsuperscriptBox["V", "xxx", "c"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "9bee3a79-ecaf-4a3a-8f2a-b23accdf330b"],
 ", ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubsuperscriptBox["V", "xxy", "c"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "8a7ba025-54b8-4324-be34-77696a7202a0"],
 ", ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubsuperscriptBox["V", "xxz", "c"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "1cb06c4b-4daf-4ad8-8a4d-7053752864f2"],
 ", ",
 Cell[BoxData[
